Plain Corpus

A soft-broken paragraph that continues here and ends here.

A long paragraph that keeps going well past any narrow
width, so that it has to wrap more than once at forty
columns and at eighty columns too, while under an unlimited
width it stays on a single line from its first word all the
way through to its very last word.

Run `md compose` with bold words and italic words.

```yaml
name: string(required)
```

┌──────┬──────┐
│ Name │ Type │
├──────┼──────┤
│ id   │ ulid │
└──────┴──────┘

---

> Quoted text keeps a visible marker.

- Item one
  - Nested item
- Item two

1. First
2. Second

See the docs <https://example.com/docs> and
https://example.com/same.

